# our ESC/P test pages (tools/dev/st/make_escp_pages.py: TEXT.PRN, every
# text mode; GRAPH.PRN, every bit-image density), sent byte by byte through
# BIOS Bconout(0) by PRFILES.PRG from the floppy's AUTO folder
# (make_bench_disks.sh, escp.st). The printer port must receive the two files
# exactly (the run's printer.out against them).
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
printwatch
key 0x39
printer 2000 4000
